WEBVTT

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.510
Fumi-cha-!

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:12.810
Huh?

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.200
You're always so quick to cry, Fumi-chan.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:56.090
Hold the train, please!

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.260
Look, it's sleeping.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:21.290
It's so cute.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.740
Fumi-chan, look, look!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:56.520
I can't believe we ran into each other going
to school <i>and </i>on the way home!

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.860
Y-Yeah.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.750
Oh, I guess it's not that random, since
we have the same commute, pretty much.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.320
Hey, what's Fujigaya like?

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.330
What do you mean?

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.620
Like the school buildings and stuff.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:15.350
Oh, they're old and made out of
wood, but they feel so nice!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.380
There's a chapel and the library's
bookshelves are made of wood!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.550
Yeah? That sounds awesome.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.670
How was Matsuoka?

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:23.550
Huh?

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:28.240
Oh, I guess it's just a normal school.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.590
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.050
Yay!

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.420
Hey, wanna go to school
together tomorrow too?

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.240
Huh?

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:46.740
Sure.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:50.900
I'm back.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:52.930
Welcome home.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:58.860
Oh, Fumi. I think Achan likes ohagi rice cakes,
but do you remember if she does?

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.790
I don't.

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:04.220
Why do you want to know?

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:07.350
I wanted to repay her, so I invited
Sakiko and Achan here.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.440
I think she liked it, but I'm not sure...

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.060
You really don't remember?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.620
What did Achan like again?

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:33.120
She was always making sweets
with Chizu-chan.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:38.730
Oh, it happened again.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.340
This handkerchief...

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:51.340
Aw, you didn't have to wash it.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.980
You're so diligent, Fumi-chan.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:58.310
Say, do you like ohagi rice cakes?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.780
I love 'em.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:03.790
I loved the ones Aunt
Yoshie used to make.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.760
Oh, I see.

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:10.340
My mom's memory is amazing.
I didn't remember that at all.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:11.900
You're cruel!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:16.950
I used to eat yours too because
you don't like red bean jam.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.390
Yeah?

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:23.560
Yes. Your aunt was so scary.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.760
She'd get all angry if we
didn't clean our plates.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.050
Amazake...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.760
Don't force yourself if you can't drink it.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:37.260
She'll yell at me if I don't drink it all.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.820
Quite the predicament you're in.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:41.960
Can I have it?

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:42.830
Hmm?

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.200
Are you all right, Achan?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.750
Hey! You're remembering something funny!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:54.710
Tell me! What is it?

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.780
Come on!

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.090
Thank you.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.280
Thank you.

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.630
Thank you!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.230
Thank you!{do me a favor and leave a gap
of like 0.2 seconds between these}

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.160
First Year, Class Fuji

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:21.650
So, did you decide what you're
gonna do, Ikumi-san?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.190
Not yet. How about you, Okudaira-san?

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:30.240
I'm thinking of joining some club that
just screams "I'm a proper young girl."

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.850
Like the Tea Ceremony Club or
Flower Arranging Club.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.960
The Drama Club would be nice too!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.710
I wonder if it'll be like the Takarazuka
all-women revue.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.550
You're so cute, Okudaira-san.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.280
Yes! Someone called me cute!

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.340
The Drama Club, huh?

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:52.280
Drama Club

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.530
Looks like fun.

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:54.100
It'll be a blast, I'm telling you!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:57.460
I mean, you have to join a
club, so you might as well-

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.740
I-I'm gonna go wash my hands.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:01.400
Huh?

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.890
Wait, Manjome-san!

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.320
I feel like they're gonna
walk all over me.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:14.680
Huh?

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.560
Literary Club

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:21.760
You know, if I have to choose,
this is more my style.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.220
You're a first year?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:28.750
Huh?

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:30.450
Oh, yes.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.050
You're tall, huh?

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.210
Oh, yes. Thank you so much.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:44.680
Have you decided on a club?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.430
No, not yet.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:51.550
The deadline is approaching, so
you'd better hurry and decide.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.600
R-Right.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.660
How about joining our club?

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.970
Literary Club

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.970
The Literary Club?!

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:07.520
Why would you pick that one?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.160
Traitor!

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.480
I'm sorry. I just...

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:13.730
I already joined the Drama Club!

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:15.760
Oh, I'm sorry. I really am.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.330
Figures.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.330
I'm really sorry.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.730
Guess this is fate.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.730
You're mean. So mean!

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.710
Wow, the Literary Club...

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.340
I think you'll fit in well with them.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.320
What was that upperclassman like?

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:31.730
I'm not sure how to answer that, umm...

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:37.200
I mean, we only met the one time.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.040
Interesting...

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.620
Oh, you've got a cellphone.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.910
Yup, they bought it for me the other day.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.910
Whoops.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.660
What's wrong?

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:51.020
My mom had something come up
at the last minute, I guess.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.450
Oh, I see.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.380
But having a cellphone comes
in handy for things like that.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.650
You should get them to buy you one too!

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.110
We can text each other.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.730
Yeah. That might be nice.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:04.990
Coming!

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:07.080
Oh, I've been expecting you.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.470
Sorry for not giving more notice.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.010
Who is it?

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:09.270
Oh, no.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.760
It's quite all right. Is this your husband?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.320
Nice to meet you.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.400
Wow, what a handsome man.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.600
Come on in already.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.570
Yes, thanks for having us.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.570
Thanks for having us.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:23.660
Fumi-chan, Chizu-chan and her husband
are here, so come say hi later.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:27.930
Achan, I'll get you a futon
after you take a bath.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:30.670
OK!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:41.930
Chizu-chan is cruel.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.510
So cruel.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.840
Fumi-chan, what's wrong?

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:58.970
There there...

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.890
There's no need to cry.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.960
Achan.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:18.970
Hmm?

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:22.270
Can you sleep next to me?

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.360
Sure.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:29.680
You're so big and yet you need
someone to sleep next to you.

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.280
Fumi-chan,

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.600
am I no good?

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.490
Do I scare you?

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.750
I don't know.

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:49.530
You're cute, Fumi-chan.

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.770
It's not that I didn't know.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.280
It was just a little scary.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.310
Stop crying.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:05.750
See.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:12.530
You used to always hold my
hand whenever I cried.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:16.030
Let's go to bed. It's past our bedtime.

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.210
OK.

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:27.370
She's so upset because her older
cousin got married...

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:33.260
Did she really love her cousin that much?

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:37.470
So much...

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:43.830
Literary Club

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:47.110
Oh, we have someone like that in our club?

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:50.710
Umm, she was tall with short hair...

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.590
For now, just write your
name and class on here.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:55.740
Oh, sure.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:00.480
But tall with short hair...

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.100
Hey.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.680
Umm...

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:08.990
Did you mean her?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:09.830
Huh?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.790
She's on the basketball team.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:12.540
Hmm?

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.560
She's my friend.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.000
Basketball?

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:20.940
Fumi Manjome

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.330
Fumi Manjome-san, huh?

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.600
I'm Yasuko Sugimoto, a third year.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.790
Nice to meet you again.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.550
Fuji Manjome - Basketball

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.560
Basketball?!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.740
What made you choose that?!

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:36.400
All the clubs have the same
registration form, so...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.700
That's not the problem!

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.900
The basketball team and the Literary
Club have nothing in common!

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.220
Interesting development.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.900
I guess.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:48.620
You'll have to start backstage
if you've never acted before.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.940
Drama Club

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.940
You know, making costumes
and sets and stuff.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.150
Are you OK with that?

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.930
Absolutely.

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.170
No problem here.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:02.830
We're putting on a play soon, so we're
definitely looking for new blood.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.990
But we work our girls hard,

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.920
so be ready for it.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:08.790
We will.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:16.980
She said she was throwing
up all night long.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.990
You think she'll be OK without
someone to be with her?

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.240
She said she'll be fine, so just go.

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:24.940
I got it.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:29.870
How can she catch a cold on the
day of the wedding ceremony?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.710
Mom, Dad, I'm sorry.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:40.490
The truth is I didn't throw up all night.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.660
I didn't catch a cold either.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.130
The truth is...

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:48.580
Congratulations on your wedding, Chizu-chan.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.580
I didn't want to go.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:12.090
Hello, Manjome here.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.950
Oh, Achan?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.450
Huh?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.150
Yeah. I'm free.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.930
Free, free, free! Super free!

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.650
So you're super free too!
Where should we go?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:46.650
Who the heck mixes up the Literary
Club with the basketball team?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:54.470
Still, the way you just rushed
in is so you, Fumi-chan.

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.930
I think I would have been better
off in the Drama Club, though.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.210
Oh, I joined the Drama Club.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.310
What? That's incredible!

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:06.830
I joined with Ikumi-san from my class.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.080
Check this out.

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:08.980
Hmm?

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.610
"The Little Prince."

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.350
"Little Women."

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.130
"Wuthering Heights."

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:18.760
Awesome!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.550
Are you going to be on stage?

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.640
No way!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:25.040
There are a bunch of really good actresses.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:31.650
But still, just being able to help out
backstage really excites me.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:34.120
That's true.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:37.400
It really is.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:51.080
It looks like Achan searched and
found something she likes.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.550
I'm envious.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:58.540
I need to let them know that I won't
join the basketball team.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.990
<i>Man, I'm beat.</i>

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.710
<i>Oh, the light's on.</i>

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.040
Oh no!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.100
<i>Fumi, are you awake?</i>

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.560
Fumi! Fumi!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:21.160
I'm glad you came to see me, Manjome-san.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.960
No, it's just...

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.410
So, what's up?

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.980
Oh, it's just, umm...

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.330
I have something I need to tell you.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.330
I see.

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:34.720
You into acting?

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.380
Acting?

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.490
I don't <i>not</i> like it.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:42.010
Great. Check this out.

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:42.700
Huh?

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:45.200
That's Fujigaya's...

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:48.720
Yup. A pamphlet for Fujigaya
Academy's Drama Club.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:52.150
Let's see...

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.910
What's up?

00:16:56.800 --> 00:17:01.480
To Kyoko Ikumi

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:00.340
A letter? Could it be a love letter?

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:01.510
It could be.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:05.150
Wow, I didn't know people
actually wrote those.

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:06.620
It's from a middle schooler.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.320
Are you gonna meet up?

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:12.290
I'm honored they had the courage to
come into the high school building,

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:15.330
but I've got someone I like already.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.860
Do you mean me?

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.770
Good question.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:39.530
<i>Pray within thine pure heart.{kiyoki
kokoro ni inori mote}</i>

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.710
I wonder why...

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:39.540
I thought that maybe the person
Ikumi-san likes is a girl.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:50.000
<i>Be at peace within thine vast heart.{yasuragi aran mikokoro ni}</i>

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:42.750
For some reason...

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:47.350
...that's what I thought.

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.340
Wow!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.950
It's Fujigaya!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.710
The girls are so proper.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.260
That's the back gate.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.930
The main gate is a little bigger.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.660
What?!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:04.140
What kind of school is this?

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.830
<i>This is just the back gate?!</i>

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:07.840
Sorry, they said they had to
see Fujigaya at least once.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:11.660
Don't worry about it. They got
permission from a Fujigaya girl.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.930
That's better than going it alone.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:19.030
Drama Club

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.020
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.910
Long time no see. You're early.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.440
Are those the girls who wanted to see us?

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:30.090
Yep.

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:31.310
Fumi-chan!

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.260
What are you doing here?

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.350
Umm, well...

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.780
You know her?

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:40.890
She's Akira Okudaira-san. We've been
friends since elementary school.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.180
And this is-

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.860
Yoko Hon'atsugi at your service.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.280
I'm Miwa Motegi.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.850
I'm Misako Yasuda.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.360
They're in the Drama Club too.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.380
So they're friends too.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.020
I brought them here because they
wanted to see Fujigaya's.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.630
Looks like it.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.050
Wow...

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:56.010
So, why'd you bring that
underclassmen here?

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.530
Just look at how tall she is.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.900
She is tall. She's about as tall as you.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.890
Right? So I figured-

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:08.250
But, I can't imagine anyone but
you for the role of Heathcliff.

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:12.620
Easy for you to say.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.770
So you joined the Drama Club.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.770
Is it fun?

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:30.390
It's a lot of fun. They've only let me
help backstage so far, though.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.510
I could see you making a good princess.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:39.870
I made myself a candidate for the
role of Catherine, if it's available.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.990
Because I'm playing Heathcliff?

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:51.570
I'd be happy just watching you
play Heathcliff in this play.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.000
Kyoko,

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:58.990
will merely watching satisfy you?

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:05.670
Oh, lover within my heart,
heed my words this time!

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:07.000
Catherine!

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:10.260
This window makes me wanna act like that.

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.480
Uh, you already are.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.680
But you're still cool!

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.380
Hey, wanna see the chapel?

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.050
What?

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.690
There's a chapel too?

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:19.970
Yeah, wanna go?

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:21.660
Yes! I wanna see it!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.180
Me too! Me too!

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:23.970
Me too!

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.470
Ah, hold on!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:28.140
They're getting along really
well, just like that.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.370
This really is a lovely place.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.280
A boardinghouse.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.090
A tea hall.

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.040
Rose parties.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.580
Secret meetings.

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.060
Séances.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.970
A window that peers out from the library.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:52.350
This is bad. I'm in love.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.030
Spring Storm

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.860
See you next time.
